                    {
                        "sense_id": "665b46b3-b1fa-3106-8016-1201a3bc8d73",
                        "entry_id": "09710cd4-3fa5-3989-9321-824dd05f282d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sexual relations and cohabitation between a man and his daughter-in-law"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a780d1fa-2cea-4e86-bef9-7852b8be0006",
                                "sense_id": "665b46b3-b1fa-3106-8016-1201a3bc8d73",
                                "text": "Для большей ясности моих слов ещё прибавлю, что Писемский в Петербурге написал повесть-драму «Батька» из безобразнейшей черты русского народа — снохачества.",
                                "translation": "For greater clarity of my words, I will add that Pisemsky wrote a dramatic story in St. Petersburg called “Batka” about the most ugly feature of the Russian people – the practice of snokhachestvo. - P. V. Annenkov, Letters to I. S. Turgenev, 1852–1874",
                                "english": "For greater clarity of my words, I will add that Pisemsky wrote a dramatic story in St. Petersburg called “Batka” about the most ugly feature of the Russian people – the practice of snokhachestvo. - P. V. Annenkov, Letters to I. S. Turgenev, 1852–1874"
                            }
                        ]
